-   d. Retrieve chunk data from `ChunkCache` using `CI` [S1, unofficial]. If data is null or the block at `LB` is `Air`, continue to the next offset [S1, unofficial].
-   e. Calculate block center:
-      $$ \text{BlockCenter} = ((\text{GX} + 0.5) \times S, (\text{GY} + 0.5) \times S, (\text{GZ} + 0.5) \times S) $$
-      [S1, unofficial]
